@title How an upload reaches storage

diagram up dir=LR title="Upload path"
up: user "Browser" user
up: api "Upload API" svc focus
up: q "Scan queue" queue
up: scan "Virus scan" fn
up: store "Object store" store
up: user -> api : PUT
up: api -> q : enqueue
up: q --> scan : async
up: scan -> store : clean files
up: user -x- store : no direct writes
up: legend

The browser never writes to the object store directly; every file passes the scanner first.
